  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your thirst for revenge is unwavering.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Amateur Gunslinger<sup>UC</sup> or grit class feature, bind spirit class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> While you are bound to a spirit, you can spend 1 grit as an immediate action in order to gain DR 1/– and resistance 5 against all types of energy damage against attacks made or spells cast by any creature that qualifies as your bound spirit’s favored enemy until the end of the turn.</p>\n<p>When your binder level reaches 5th and every five levels thereafter, increase the DR that you receive from this feat by 1 and the resistance by 5, up to DR 5/– and energy resistance 20.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/pact-magic-feats#toc28\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
